{:edb/db-before-t 2827 :edb/db-after-t 2828 :edb/tx-data [[13194139536140 50 #inst "2026-10-09T16:36:30.710Z" 13194139536140 true] [17592186119800 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385644 13194139536140 true] [17592186119800 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385651 13194139536140 true] [17592186119800 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385693 13194139536140 true] [17592186119905 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385637 13194139536140 true] [17592186119905 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385686 13194139536140 true] [17592186119906 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385658 13194139536140 true] [17592186119906 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385665 13194139536140 true] [17592186119907 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385672 13194139536140 true] [17592186119907 1020 #edb/ref 17592186385679 13194139536140 true] [17592186120111 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536140 true] [17592186120111 1100 "Calculate\n\n$∫_{1}^{2}f(t)dt$\ngiven that\n$∫_{0}^{1}f(t)dt = ⟨2,-2, 1⟩$\nand\n$∫_{2}^{0}f(t)dt = ⟨ - 16, 8,-32⟩$." 13194139536140 false] [17592186120111 1100 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨2,\\,-2,\\,1⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-16,\\,8,\\,-32⟩.$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186120111 1145 "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-16,\\,8,\\,-32⟩-⟨2,\\,-2,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨14,\\,-6,\\,31⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186120484 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536140 true] [17592186120484 1100 "Calculate\n\n$∫_{0}^{1}2f(t)dt$\ngiven that\n$∫_{1}^{0}f(t)dt = ⟨1,-3, 2⟩$." 13194139536140 false] [17592186120484 1100 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{1}2f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨1,\\,-3,\\,2⟩.$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186120484 1145 "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨1,\\,-3,\\,2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,3,\\,-2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, applying the scalar multiplication rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}2f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2\\cdot ⟨-1,\\,3,\\,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,6,\\,-4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385637 1017 #edb/ref 17592186385638 13194139536140 true] [17592186385637 1089 "q-129149" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385637 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536140 true] [17592186385637 1100 "Calculate ${\\int }_{0}^{3}[2f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t$ given that ${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-3,\\,\\sqrt{2},\\,2⟩$ and ${\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-\\frac{3}{2},\\,-\\frac{1}{4},\\,1⟩.$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385637 1113 #uuid "57f0244e-104a-5517-a9c5-a53620a2a15d" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385637 1145 "From the vector addition and scalar multiplication rules, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}[2f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t=2{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+4{\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}[2f(t)+4g(t)]\\,\\text{d}t & =2{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+4{\\int }_{0}^{3}g(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2⟨-3,\\,\\sqrt{2},\\,2⟩+4⟨-\\frac{3}{2},\\,-\\frac{1}{4},\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-6,\\,2\\sqrt{2},\\,4⟩+⟨-6,\\,-1,\\,4⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-12,\\,2\\sqrt{2}-1,\\,8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385638 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385639 13194139536140 true] [17592186385638 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385640 13194139536140 true] [17592186385638 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385641 13194139536140 true] [1759218