e the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{2}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-\\frac{1}{2},\\,1,\\,\\frac{3}{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{2},\\,-1,\\,-\\frac{3}{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, applying the scalar multiplication rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}4f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =4{\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =4\\cdot ⟨\\frac{1}{2},\\,-1,\\,-\\frac{3}{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,-4,\\,-6⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385645 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385646 13194139536140 true] [17592186385645 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385647 13194139536140 true] [17592186385645 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385648 13194139536140 true] [17592186385645 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385649 13194139536140 true] [17592186385645 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385650 13194139536140 true] [17592186385645 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536140 true] [17592186385645 1041 "selection" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385645 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385648 13194139536140 true] [17592186385645 1110 #uuid "0b7542aa-9b6c-5998-bc1d-9e2f5d8669fb" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385646 1034 "⟨-1,\\,5,\\,-6⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385646 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385646 1111 #uuid "0c2011a0-54e9-5ba5-89fb-b251d1fae5d5" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385647 1034 "⟨1,\\,-1,\\,3⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385647 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385647 1111 #uuid "e6ff558c-8360-512c-bde3-20f957a5282f" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385648 1034 "⟨2,\\,-4,\\,-6⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385648 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385648 1111 #uuid "d04f570d-b83b-5daf-9e1d-5c916df8a5d5" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385649 1034 "⟨2,\\,8,\\,-2⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385649 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385649 1111 #uuid "bc4c23f1-722c-5251-8579-b13d6f31d8f4" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385650 1034 "⟨-2,\\,-1,\\,-3⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385650 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385650 1111 #uuid "0b3b6fb2-1ea3-5ca3-a4a7-d4a066fe4bd1" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385651 1017 #edb/ref 17592186385652 13194139536140 true] [17592186385651 1089 "q-129268" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385651 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536140 true] [17592186385651 1100 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{4}^{0}f(t)+⟨3,\\,1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-3,\\,6,\\,0⟩.$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385651 1113 #uuid "c638b3b7-3387-51ff-9f13-b6611ac87542" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385651 1145 "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{0}^{4}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-3,\\,6,\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,-6,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{0}f(t)+⟨3,\\,1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{4}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{4}^{0}⟨3,\\,1,\\,-2⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,-6,\\,0⟩+⟨3t,\\,t,\\,-2t⟩{|}_{4}^{0} \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,-6,\\,0⟩+⟨-12,\\,-4,\\,8⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨-9,\\,-10,\\,8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385652 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385653 13194139536140 true] [17592186385652 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385654 13194139536140 true] [17592186385652 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385655 13194139536140 true] [17592186385652 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385656 13194139536140 true] [17592186385652 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385657 13194139536140 true] [17592186385652 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536140 true] [17592186385652 1041 "selection" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385652 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385656 13194139536140 true] [17592186385652 1110 #uuid "5708c38e-29b0-5f2f-9e03-f8c712e0d556" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385653 1034 "⟨15,\\,-2,\\,8⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385653 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385653 1111 #uuid "df17aff7-1bf8-53c2-b657-9fcddc1d8a8d" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385654 1034 "⟨-13,\\,-5,\\,3⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385654 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385654 1111 #uuid "df49835e-6680-5a81-a358-459a7993712b" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385655 1034 "⟨-9,\\,-8,\\,10⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385655 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385655 1111 #uuid "5a34fa82-7098-57b5-b7c2-80ff1382aa79" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385656 1034 "⟨-9,\\,-10,\\,8⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385656 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385656 1111 #uuid "c08d5330-68df-5a71-b760-f1a6262c6c3b" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385657 1034 "⟨9,\\,-12,\\,3⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385657 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385657 1111 #uuid "6b4bfcbc-1507-5ff4-b49a-d36f018af706" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385658 1017 #edb/ref 17592186385659 13194139536140 true] [17592186385658 1089 "q-129272" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385658 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536140 true] [17592186385658 1100 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨1,\\,2,\\,-1⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨2,\\,4,\\,-10⟩.$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385658 1113 #uuid "78c4a8a8-5c24-5d9d-99b9-eb62aeea153c" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385658 1145 "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{1}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-(-{\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t) \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{1}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,4,\\,-10⟩+⟨1,\\,2,\\,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,6,\\,-11⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385659 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385660 13194139536140 true] [17592186385659 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385661 13194139536140 true] [17592186385659 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385662 13194139536140 true] [17592186385659 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385663 13194139536140 true] [17592186385659 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385664 13194139536140 true] [17592186385659 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536140 true] [17592186385659 1041 "selection" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385659 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385660 13194139536140 true] [17592186385659 1110 #uuid "26ccb60f-dd56-5b6c-b05b-4478675e58b7" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385660 1034 "⟨3,\\,6,\\,-11⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385660 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385660 1111 #uuid "0da14a70-0a80-5eab-8edb-9ce909648909" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385661 1034 "⟨1,\\,-2,\\,11⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385661 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385661 1111 #uuid "c9acf765-9354-59b3-885b-46cac8c6f6e9" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385662 1034 "⟨2,\\,2,\\,-9⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385662 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385662 1111 #uuid "5d9caab8-a0e1-528c-b8f4-0743b409cdef" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385663 1034 "⟨3,\\,2,\\,-9⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385663 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385663 1111 #uuid "f13f40a6-70ac-59a2-b26f-f2c7483409db" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385664 1034 "⟨5,\\,-1,\\,-9⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385664 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385664 1111 #uuid "5c01c4ac-119b-5bf5-8946-587c5c708b94" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385665 1017 #edb/ref 17592186385666 13194139536140 true] [17592186385665 1089 "q-129275" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385665 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536140 true] [17592186385665 1100 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{3}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{5}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-4,\\,-12,\\,14⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨2,\\,8,\\,-8⟩.$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385665 1113 #uuid "6667ee1e-5bac-5bbf-a31f-37a435ae5255" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385665 1145 "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{3}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{3}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{3}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{5}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨-4,\\,-12,\\,14⟩-⟨2,\\,8,\\,-8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,\\,12,\\,-14⟩-⟨2,\\,8,\\,-8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,4,\\,-6⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385666 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385667 13194139536140 true] [17592186385666 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385668 13194139536140 true] [17592186385666 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385669 13194139536140 true] [17592186385666 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385670 13194139536140 true] [17592186385666 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385671 13194139536140 true] [17592186385666 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536140 true] [17592186385666 1041 "selection" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385666 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385670 13194139536140 true] [17592186385666 1110 #uuid "417efc58-30d3-57fd-aa8c-e321300dd5c1" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385667 1034 "⟨6,\\,-4,\\,-16⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385667 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385667 1111 #uuid "ae0bea1f-2f66-53af-abf0-ed570eb0d2ca" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385668 1034 "⟨-6,\\,-20,\\,22⟩" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385668 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385668 1111 #uuid "a8ee4693-b671-5c0