\n{\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\cdot f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=c\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nApplying the dot-product rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\cdot f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =c\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(-i+j+3\\,k)\\cdot (16\\,i-10\\,j+4\\,k) \\\\  & =-16-10+12 \\\\  & =-14.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385680 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385681 13194139536140 true] [17592186385680 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385682 13194139536140 true] [17592186385680 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385683 13194139536140 true] [17592186385680 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385684 13194139536140 true] [17592186385680 1000 #edb/ref 17592186385685 13194139536140 true] [17592186385680 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536140 true] [17592186385680 1041 "selection" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385680 1104 #edb/ref 17592186385682 13194139536140 true] [17592186385680 1110 #uuid "ebab6afb-0750-56e9-8ac9-9409f800bf76" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385681 1034 "-16" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385681 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385681 1111 #uuid "bf487f86-19d3-505b-837d-ebca1bf27ae2" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385682 1034 "-14" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385682 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385682 1111 #uuid "262a9bb1-68d7-5777-8f53-10cfe7e24b9f" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385683 1034 "10" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385683 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385683 1111 #uuid "747136e9-ae76-55a2-a5e8-335f8fd702e1" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385684 1034 "3" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385684 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385684 1111 #uuid "757662f5-54d5-561a-a7ee-188ade5328da" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385685 1034 "14" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385685 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536140 true] [17592186385685 1111 #uuid "2d34df2f-35dc-5415-8b7a-7d1607ca33d0" 13194139536140 true] [17592186385686 1017 #edb